    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d671">

                <pb facs="0819" n="695" xml:id="pg695"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">837.00/2109: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Minister in Cuba</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Long</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1921-05-12T16:00:00-04:00"><hi rendition="#italic">May 12, 1921—4
                                p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>107. For General Crowder.</p>
                <p>Your despatch of May 2.</p>
                <p>You may advise General Menocal that he would be received in the Department with
                    pleasure if he found it convenient to visit Washington before his departure for
                    Europe.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hughes</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
